        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nalanjisia mumarwi kanje nomwoyo omukhongo, ari Site ahambi, inywe abakuumi beshialo, buli mundu neshimanulwashie shiobumululi mumukhono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana lola, abasaatsa basasaba nibeetsa, nibarula enashilibwa shiemukulu, eshili enotsi, buli mundu nali nende eshimanulwashie shiobwiri mumukhono. Ne yaliho mulala hakari wabwe owali niyeefwalile tsingubo tsieikitani, nali nende eshimuka shiobwino eshiomuhandiichi, nishiboyilwe khukhukunyu. Nabo nibeenjila, nibasinjila hashimalilo shiomukasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho ing'oono yoluyali lwaNyasaye waIsiraeli yali niyitikuluushe olchurula khubakerubi ewa yalinji, niyulile hamushingachi kweinzu; mana nalanga omundu tsana owali niyeefwalile tsingubo tsieikitani, owali nende eshimuka shiobwino eshimuhandiichi khukhukunyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namubiila mbu Tsia obire hakari welitookho, mbu hakari waYerusaiemu, norakhwo eshimanyilo khubweni bwabandu abeesia amahumo nibabinda khulwa ebisinyo ebikholekhanga hakari walio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabandi abo, yababoolela nimbulila, mbu Mubire mwitookho munyumawe, murootse; tsimoni tsieenywe tsileshe okhubeelelela, kata mulabakhwo netsimbabasi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwire bwira abakofu, abasooliili nabakhaana, abaana abahele nabakhasi; nebutswa murasita ahambi khumundu yesi ouli neshimanyilo ta; ne mulachaachila ahatakatifu wanje. Mana nibachaachila khubakofu abali nibali imbeli weinzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabasunjila mbu Mwonoonie inzu, nimwitsusia tsinyanyi tsiosi nabeerwa; khatsie. Nibatsia, nibarootsa abomwitookho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibarootsanga, nasi nindong'ile sienyene, ndeekhupa hasi mafumama, nikhupa tsimbungu, nisunga mbu E Omwami NYASAYE! Witsa okhutibia omusilealo kwosi kwaIsiraeli, nosundula obululubwo khu Yerusalemu, noho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
